// Issue #319: crash reports. 01 The cadrs closed unexpectedly dialog a start after a crash shows
// (here on a sample report: scenarios keep no crash reports): what happened, the panic's message,
// place, thread and first cadrs frame, that nothing is sent without the person, and Show files,
// Copy report, Add document, Close and Report on GitHub. 02 The app menu ends with Report a
// problem…, which opens the same dialog for the running session.
Scenario(
    start: Some("landing"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("app-menu"),
        Custom("crash-dialog"),
        WaitFor("crash-dialog"),
        Hover(ui_at("crash-dialog", 0.9375, 0.96)),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-crash-dialog"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("app-menu")),
        WaitFor("app-report-problem"),
        Hover(ui("app-report-problem")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-app-menu-report-a-problem"),
    ],
)
